      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Exact two-dimensional critical phenomena and conformal field theory revealed deep universal structure in statistical physics and quantum field theory.",
        "attribution": "The listed scientists made pivotal but differently situated contributions to conformal methods, exact results, and their physical interpretation.",
        "maturity": "The framework is longstanding, mathematically powerful, and continuously productive across physics.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Attribution is exceptionally diffuse, with several indispensable contributors outside the listed names.",
