        "attribution": "Katori introduced the magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept, and Ye made decisive independent advances toward leading experimental realizations.",
        "maturity": "The clocks have achieved extraordinary reproducibility and are mature enough to reshape standards and geodesy.",
